@startuml PDF_Document_Upload_Process
' [OUTDATED] This sequence uses the legacy endpoint /upload/file/pdf and generic storage steps.
' Current upload endpoints are:
' - POST /api/v1/pdf/upload (single PDF)
' - POST /api/v1/tasks/requests/upload (task_form + files (PDF/DOCX))
'
' If you need an updated diagram, regenerate based on src/api/routes/core.py and src/api/routes/task.py.

title [OUTDATED] PDF Document Upload Process
actor User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend API" as BE
database "Database" as DB
participant "File Storage" as FS
User -> FE: Select PDF file to upload
FE -> BE: POST /upload/file/pdf with PDF file
BE -> BE: Validate file type and size
alt Valid PDF
    BE -> FS: Store PDF file
    FS --> BE: Return file storage path
    BE -> DB: Save document metadata (filename, path, upload time)
    DB --> BE: Confirm metadata saved
    BE --> FE: Return success response with document ID
else Invalid PDF
    BE --> FE: Return error response (invalid file type/size)
end
@enduml